.TH PRIVAI 1 &quot;Feb 3, 2026&quot; &quot;1.0&quot; &quot;PrivAI&quot;
.SH NAME
privai \\- TUI chat client for Ollama dev agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B privai
.SH DESCRIPTION
PrivAI is a terminal user interface for chatting with a local Ollama LLM (default llama3.2).
It injects workspace context (ls, git) into prompts for dev assistance.
.SH OPTIONS
None (TUI app).
.SH KEYS
Enter \\- Send message
q, Ctrl+C \\- Quit
Tab \\- Focus input
Esc \\- Blur input
.SH PREREQUISITES
Ollama running on localhost:11434 with llama3.2 model.
.SH FILES
/usr/local/bin/privai
.SH SEE ALSO
ollama(1), bubbletea(1)
.SH AUTHOR
cli_craftsman (The Foundry)